var arr = [1 , 2];
var obj = {"foo": "bar" ,"baz": "qur"};
foo(a ,b);
new Foo(a ,b);
function baz(a ,b){}
a ,b
```

Examples of correct code for this rule with the default `{ "before": false, "after": true }` options:


```json
