obj[foo[ bar ]]

const { [ a ]: someProp } = obj;
({ [ b ]: anotherProp } = anotherObj);
```

Examples of correct code for this rule with the default `"never"` option:


```json
/*eslint computed-property-spacing: ["error", "never"]*/
/*eslint-env es6*/

